[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0010","text":"────对我来说，\n重要的不是成为顶点"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0020","text":"而是持续朝着顶点前进"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0030","text":"……不过，偶尔会有疑问闪过脑海"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0040","text":"你是说——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0050","text":"能说是“真心”吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0060","text":"……呼……呼……呼……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0070","text":"──观测火星的卫星火卫一和火卫二，\n采集样本后返回地……返……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0080","text":"返回，是“回来”的意思"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0090","text":"返……还！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0100","text":"──火卫一和火卫二！\n感觉名字好酷啊！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0110","text":"你知道它们的意思吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0120","text":"它们有意义吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0130","text":"去查查看"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0140","text":"是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0142","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0150","text":"嗯……\n“恐惧”和“混乱”……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0160","text":"很可怕的名字对吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0170","text":"我们要去这种地方吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0180","text":"是啊\n探测器从地球出发，踏上漫长的旅程"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0190","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0200","text":"宇宙之旅艰辛而痛苦\n但在那前方，有无论如何都想要的东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0210","text":"────你有吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0220","text":"你有吗？\n有栖川夏叶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0221","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0230","text":"──那么差不多要开始了\n先从小宫女士开始可以吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0240","text":"好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0241","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0250","text":"这次就任火星卫星探测计划的\n形象大使，恭喜您"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0260","text":"非常感谢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0270","text":"今天希望能听到您关于决心等各方面的想法──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0271","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0280","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0281","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0290","text":"──不会意识到的东西，就是“足够”的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0300","text":"在地球上，很少会想要氧气吧\n和那个是一样的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0310","text":"金钱、爱情、友情、地位、名誉、健康────\n平时不需要意识到的东西，就是“足够”的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0320","text":"反过来，会意识到的东西就是“欠缺”的\n────那么，有栖川小姐"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0321","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0330","text":"你想要的东西是……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0340","text":"无论多么艰辛、多么痛苦，\n都绝对想要的东西是………………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0341","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0350","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0351","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0360","text":"能变聪明的魔法，或者能瞬间移动的门之类的！\n……啊，那种的不行吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0370","text":"那我走了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0380","text":"能挺起胸膛的自己"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0381","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0390","text":"────特别想要的没有"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0400","text":"……想不出来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0410","text":"但是，一直意识到的是────成为偶像这件事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0411","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0420","text":"……让我想想……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0430","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0440","text":"……现在，脑子里只有作为偶像努力这件事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0450","text":"────我们“成为了偶像”……在那之后"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0451","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_03_0460","text":"想要什么"}]
